pvienota ar radošu vīziju. Vai vēlies sākt sadarbību?"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-left text-base leading-relaxed text-white/60 antialiased sm:mt-4 sm:text-lg sm:leading-relaxed","children":"Ar zināšanām programmēšanas inženierijā, radošajā vadībā un dizainā es harmoniski apvienoju tehnoloģijas un estētiku, lai radītu aizraujošas un augstas kvalitātes digitālās pieredzes. Mani iedvesmo skaistuma radīšana, kas uzrunā, pārvēršot idejas spilgtos vizuālos tēlos un kodā, kas iedvesmo. Manā skatījumā programmatūras inženierija nav tikai loģika — tā ir māksla, kas apvieno funkcionalitāti ar iztēli."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"--stagger":2},"data-animate":true,"className":"mt-10 flex min-w-0 w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-4 sm:mt-14 lg:mt-16 xl:max-w-6xl","children":["$","$Lf",null,{"projects":[{"name":"Expanders","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vdeksne/portfolio-images-2025/refs/heads/main/Portfolio1.jpg","link":"https://platform.showheroes.com/format-demos/preview.html#midroll=true&preview=1&f=intext&source=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.create.showheroes.com%2Fcreatives%2F6336%2Fvast%3Fpreview_duration%3D20%26preview_countdown%3D3%26swipe_area%3D74%26version%3D3%26preview%3D1%26gdpr%3D%7Bgdpr%7D%26cs%3D%7Bgdpr_consent%7D%26cb%3D%7Brandom%7D%26domain%3D%7Bdomain%7D%26supply_id%3D%7Bsite_id%7D%26demand_id%3D%7Bcampaign_id%7D%26demand_id_2%3D%7Bline_item_id%7D%26device_type%3D%7Bdevice_type%7D%26utm_medium%3D%7Bcampaign_id%7D%26utm_campaign%3D%7Bcampaign_name%7D%26utm_term%3D%7Bline_item_name%7D%26utm_content%3D%7Bline_item_id%7D","release":"2024","featured":true},{"name":"Gallery Tool","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vdeksne/portfolio-images-2025/refs/heads/main/Portfolio2.jpg","link":"https://gallery-tool.netlify.app/","release":"2024","featured":true},{"name":"MAX","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vdeksne/portfolio-images-2025/refs/heads/main/Portfolio9.jpg","link":"https://www.figma.com/proto/nAwjxFkWlRk6NoYG7WIHoF/MAX_Portfolio?page-